Ontology(<http://example.org/diff-imports>
Import(<http://example.org/diff-imports-child>)
Annotation(rdfs:comment "x")

Declaration(Class(:A))
Declaration(Class(:B))
Declaration(Class(obo:GO_0000001))
Declaration(Class(obo:GO_0000002))


